---
layout: false
title: 工具箱 — 阿程的碎碎念
---
doctype html
html(lang="zh-CN")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    meta(name="description" content="阿程的嵌入式工具箱 - 嵌入式学习过程中高频使用的工具，分类清晰，按需自取")
    title 工具箱 — 阿程的碎碎念
    link(rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com")
    link(rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin)
    link(rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@500;600;700;800&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap")
    link(rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css")
    style.
      :root {
        --bg: #faf9f6;
        --bg-soft: #f3f1ec;
        --bg-elev: #ffffff;
        --border: rgba(26,26,31,0.08);
        --border-strong: rgba(26,26,31,0.14);
        --text: #1a1a1f;
        --text-2: rgba(26,26,31,0.7);
        --text-3: rgba(26,26,31,0.48);
        --accent: #6b9e83;
        --accent-soft: #d8e6dd;
        --accent-glow: rgba(107,158,131,0.18);
        --warm: #e8a87c;
        --warm-soft: #f7e3d0;
        --peach: #f4c6a8;
        --sky: #a8c8e0;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      html, body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); }
      body {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.65;
        min-height: 100vh;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        position: relative;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
      body::before {
        content: '';
        position: fixed; inset: 0;
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 80% 0%, var(--peach) 0%, transparent 60%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 100% 80%, var(--accent-soft) 0%, transparent 60%);
        opacity: 0.3;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
      }
      .container {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 1180px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 2rem;
      }
      .topbar {
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 0.9rem 0;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
      }
      .topbar-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .status-dot {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 8px; height: 8px;
        background: var(--accent);
        border-radius: 50%;
        margin-right: 0.5rem;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--accent-glow);
        animation: pulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        vertical-align: middle;
      }
      @keyframes pulse {
        0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--accent-glow); }
        50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px transparent; }
      }
      .topbar a {
        color: var(--text);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        padding: 0.32rem 0.7rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.25rem;
      }
      .topbar a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--bg-soft);
      }
      .topbar a.active {
        color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .topbar-links { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; }

      .hero {
        padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
        position: relative;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .hero-meta {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .hero-meta .tag {
        background: var(--bg-elev);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
      }
      .hero-meta .tag.accent {
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        border-color: transparent;
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg,
          var(--text) 0%,
          var(--warm) 55%,
          var(--warm-soft) 100%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
      }
      .hero-sub {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: var(--text-2);
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        text-align: center;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      /* ===== 筛选 chip 行 ===== */
      .filter-bar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 50;
        background: rgba(250, 249, 246, 0.85);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(140%);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(140%);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 0.85rem 0;
        margin: 0 -2rem 2rem;
        padding-left: 2rem;
        padding-right: 2rem;
      }
      .filter-search {
        position: relative;
        margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
      }
      .filter-search-input {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0.65rem 2.5rem 0.65rem 1rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--bg-elev);
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--text);
        outline: none;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }
      .filter-search-input:focus {
        border-color: var(--accent);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-glow);
      }
      .filter-search-input::placeholder {
        color: var(--text-3);
      }
      .filter-search-clear {
        position: absolute;
        right: 0.7rem;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translateY(-50%);
        background: var(--bg-soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 999px;
        width: 22px; height: 22px;
        padding: 0;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        transition: all 0.15s;
      }
      .filter-search-clear:hover {
        background: var(--text-2);
        color: white;
      }
      .filter-search-hint {
        position: absolute;
        right: 0.7rem;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translateY(-50%);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .filter-row {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .filter-chip {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--text-2);
        background: var(--bg-elev);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 0.45rem 0.95rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
      }
      .filter-chip:hover {
        border-color: var(--border-strong);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }
      .filter-chip.is-active {
        background: var(--text);
        color: #fff;
        border-color: var(--text);
      }
      .filter-chip .chip-count {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
        padding: 0.05rem 0.4rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
      }
      .filter-chip:not(.is-active) .chip-count {
        background: var(--bg-soft);
        color: var(--text-3);
      }
      .filter-clear {
        margin-left: auto;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        background: transparent;
        border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong);
        padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      }
      .filter-clear:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--text-3); }
      .filter-clear[hidden] { display: none; }
      .filter-tags-active {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        width: 100%;
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
      }
      .filter-tags-active .tag-chip {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.3rem;
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        color: #4a7a64;
        padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem 0.2rem 0.6rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        margin-right: 0.3rem;
        margin-top: 0.2rem;
      }
      .filter-tags-active .tag-chip .x {
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        line-height: 1;
        opacity: 0.7;
      }
      .filter-tags-active .tag-chip .x:hover { opacity: 1; }

      /* ===== 工具网格（复用 .cat 视觉） ===== */
      .tools-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
        min-height: 220px;
      }
      .cat.tool-card {
        background: var(--bg-elev);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        text-align: left;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: inherit;
        font: inherit;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        min-height: 220px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: opacity 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s ease, filter 0.35s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
        transform: perspective(1000px) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg);
        transform-style: preserve-3d;
      }
      .tool-card[data-cat="dev"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, rgba(168,200,224,0.18) 100%); }
      .tool-card[data-cat="debug"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, rgba(200,168,224,0.20) 100%); }
      .tool-card[data-cat="ai"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, rgba(216,230,221,0.45) 100%); }
      .tool-card[data-cat="util"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, rgba(247,227,208,0.40) 100%); }
      .tool-card.is-hidden {
        opacity: 0.18;
        pointer-events: none;
        filter: grayscale(0.6);
        transform: perspective(1000px) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) scale(0.97) !important;
      }
      .tool-card::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0; right: 0;
        width: 90px; height: 90px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, var(--cat-color, var(--accent-soft)) 0%, transparent 70%);
        opacity: 0.55;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .tool-card:hover {
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(26,26,31,0.08);
        border-color: var(--border-strong);
      }
      .tool-card:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }
      .tool-card .cat-num {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        z-index: 1;
      }
      .tool-card .cat-arrow {
        position: absolute;
        top: 1.5rem;
        right: 1.5rem;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        transition: color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
        z-index: 1;
      }
      .tool-card:hover .cat-arrow { color: var(--accent); transform: translate(2px, -2px); }
      .tool-card .cat-icon {
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1;
        margin: 0.1rem 0 0.2rem;
        z-index: 1;
      }
      .tool-card h3 {
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.3;
        z-index: 1;
      }
      .tool-card .cat-desc {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.55;
        z-index: 1;
      }
      .tool-card .tool-tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.35rem;
        margin-top: 0.3rem;
        z-index: 1;
      }
      .tool-card .tool-cat-pill {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        background: var(--bg-elev);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--text-3);
        padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
      }
      .tool-card .tool-tag {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        background: transparent;
        border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong);
        color: var(--text-3);
        padding: 0.12rem 0.5rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      }
      .tool-card .tool-tag:hover {
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        border-color: transparent;
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      .tool-card .tool-tag.is-active {
        background: var(--accent);
        border-color: var(--accent);
        color: #fff;
        border-style: solid;
      }
      .tool-card .cat-foot {
        margin-top: auto;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        padding-top: 0.75rem;
        border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        z-index: 1;
      }
      .tool-card .cat-foot .links-count {
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      .tool-card .cat-foot .links-count::before { content: '● '; }
      .tool-card .cat-foot .links-count.empty { color: var(--text-3); }
      .tool-card .cat-foot .links-count.empty::before { content: '○ '; }

      /* 加载/空状态 */
      .tools-loading,
      .tools-empty {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 4rem 2rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }

      /* ===== 详情 Modal ===== */
      .tool-modal {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 1000;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 2rem;
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
      }
      .tool-modal.is-open {
        opacity: 1;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }
      .tool-modal-backdrop {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(26, 26, 31, 0.55);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px) saturate(120%);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px) saturate(120%);
      }
      .tool-modal-content {
        position: relative;
        background: var(--bg-elev);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 2.5rem;
        max-width: 580px;
        width: 100%;
        max-height: calc(100vh - 4rem);
        overflow-y: auto;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(26, 26, 31, 0.25);
        transform: translateY(20px) scale(0.96);
        transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
      }
      .tool-modal.is-open .tool-modal-content {
        transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
      }
      .tool-modal-close {
        position: absolute;
        top: 1rem;
        right: 1rem;
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--bg-soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--text-2);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
      }
      .tool-modal-close:hover {
        background: var(--text);
        color: #fff;
        transform: rotate(90deg);
      }
      .tool-modal-close:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
        outline-offset: 2px;
      }
      .tool-modal-header {
        margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
        padding-right: 0;
      }
      .tool-modal-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .tool-modal-header-text { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
      .tool-modal-visit {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #5b8a6e);
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        white-space: nowrap;
        transition: all 0.2s;
        flex: 0;
        align-self: center;
      }
      .tool-modal-visit:hover {
        filter: brightness(1.1);
        color: white;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }
      .tool-modal-icon {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 2.4rem;
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      }
      .tool-modal-title {
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }
      .tool-modal-tagline {
        color: var(--text-2);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .tool-modal-section {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      .tool-modal-section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
      .tool-modal-section-label {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      }
      .tool-modal-reason {
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .tool-modal-tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.4rem;
      }
      .tool-modal-tags .tag {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        background: var(--bg-soft);
        color: var(--text-2);
        padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
      }
      .tool-modal-links {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.85rem;
      }
      .tool-modal-link {
        background: var(--bg-soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
        transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
      }
      .tool-modal-link:hover {
        border-color: var(--border-strong);
        background: var(--bg-elev);
      }
      .tool-modal-link-head {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .tool-modal-link-type {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
      }
      .tool-modal-link-label {
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .tool-modal-link-url {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--text-2);
        word-break: break-all;
        line-height: 1.5;
        display: block;
        text-decoration: none;
        margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }
      .tool-modal-link-url:hover { color: var(--accent); }
      .tool-modal-link-code {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
      }
      .tool-modal-link-code .code-label {
        color: var(--text-3);
      }
      .tool-modal-link-code .code-value {
        background: var(--bg-elev);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 500;
        user-select: all;
      }
      .tool-modal-link-copy {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        background: var(--accent);
        color: #fff;
        border: none;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
      }
      .tool-modal-link-copy:hover {
        background: var(--text);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }
      .tool-modal-link-copy.is-copied {
        background: var(--accent);
        animation: copy-bounce 0.4s ease;
      }
      @keyframes copy-bounce {
        0% { transform: scale(1); }
        50% { transform: scale(1.1); }
        100% { transform: scale(1); }
      }
      .tool-modal-link-note {
        margin-top: 0.45rem;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        line-height: 1.5;
        font-style: italic;
      }
      .tool-modal-no-links {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        padding: 1.5rem;
        text-align: center;
        background: var(--bg-soft);
        border: 1px dashed var(--border);
        border-radius: 14px;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 2.5rem 0;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--text-3);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1rem;
        border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
        margin-top: 3rem;
      }
      .footer .build { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; }

      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .hero { padding: 3.5rem 0 2rem; }
        .filter-bar { padding-left: 1.5rem; padding-right: 1.5rem; margin: 0 -1.5rem 1.5rem; }
      }
      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        html, body { overflow-x: hidden; }
        .container { padding: 0 1.25rem; }
        .hero { padding: 3rem 0 1.75rem; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 7vw, 2.2rem); }
        .hero-sub { font-size: 0.92rem; }
        .tool-card { padding: 1.25rem; min-height: 200px; }
        .tool-modal { padding: 1rem; }
        .tool-modal-content { padding: 1.75rem; border-radius: 18px; }
        .tool-modal-title { font-size: 1.35rem; }
      }
  body
    .container
      .topbar(data-reveal="fade")
        .topbar-inner
          span
            span.status-dot
            | 阿程的碎碎念 &nbsp;//&nbsp; tools
          .topbar-links
            - var p = '/tools/'
            a(href="/" class=(p === '/' ? 'active' : '') data-magnetic="0.25") /home
            a(href="/about/" class=(p.indexOf('/about') === 0 ? 'active' : '') data-magnetic="0.25") /about
            a(href="/tools/" class=(p.indexOf('/tools') === 0 ? 'active' : '') data-magnetic="0.25") /tools
            a(href="https://b23.tv/vMZmSdE" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-magnetic="0.25") /bilibili ↗

      section.hero(data-reveal="up")
        .hero-meta
          span.tag.accent ✦ live
          span.tag ~/阿程
          span.tools-count#hero-count — —
          span · v1
        h1(data-char-in) 我的嵌入式工具箱
        p.hero-sub
          | 嵌入式学习过程中高频使用的工具，分类清晰，按需自取。

      .filter-bar(data-reveal="fade")
        // ★ 搜索框
        .filter-search
          input.filter-search-input#filter-search(type="search" placeholder="搜索工具名/标签/描述... (按 / 快速聚焦)" autocomplete="off")
          button.filter-search-clear#filter-search-clear(type="button" hidden) ✕
          span.filter-search-hint#filter-search-hint
        .filter-row
          button.filter-chip.is-active(data-cat="all" type="button")
            | 全部
            span.chip-count#chip-count-all 0
          button.filter-chip(data-cat="dev" type="button")
            | 💻 软件开发
            span.chip-count#chip-count-dev 0
          button.filter-chip(data-cat="debug" type="button")
            | 🔌 调试烧录
            span.chip-count#chip-count-debug 0
          button.filter-chip(data-cat="ai" type="button")
            | 🤖 学习辅助
            span.chip-count#chip-count-ai 0
          button.filter-chip(data-cat="util" type="button")
            | 🛠 实用工具
            span.chip-count#chip-count-util 0
          button.filter-clear#filter-clear(type="button" hidden)
            | ✕ 清空筛选
        .filter-tags-active#filter-tags-active

      section.tools-grid#tools-grid
        .tools-loading#tools-loading
          | // 加载中...

      .tools-empty#tools-empty(hidden)
        | 没有匹配的工具 · 试试清空筛选

      // 详情 Modal(共享一个,JS 填充)
      .tool-modal#tool-modal(role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title" aria-hidden="true")
        .tool-modal-backdrop(data-modal-close)
        .tool-modal-content
          button.tool-modal-close(type="button" data-modal-close aria-label="关闭详情")
            | ×
          .tool-modal-header
            .tool-modal-icon#modal-icon
            .tool-modal-header-text
              h2.tool-modal-title#modal-title
              p.tool-modal-tagline#modal-tagline
            a.tool-modal-visit#modal-visit(href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden) 🔗 打开主页
          .tool-modal-body
            .tool-modal-section
              .tool-modal-section-label // 推荐理由
              p.tool-modal-reason#modal-reason
            .tool-modal-section
              .tool-modal-section-label // 标签
              .tool-modal-tags#modal-tags
            .tool-modal-section
              .tool-modal-section-label // 下载 / 访问
              .tool-modal-links#modal-links
                .tool-modal-no-links#modal-no-links(hidden) 暂未提供外链,直接看官网或搜资料

      .footer
        span © 2026 阿程 · embedai.top
        .build
          span sha: embedai@main
          span 阿程的碎碎念

      // 数据源(编译期嵌入 source/_data/*.yml)
      script#tools-data-yaml(type="text/plain")
        include ../_data/tools.yml
      script#links-data-yaml(type="text/plain")
        include ../_data/links.yml

    script(src="/js/site.js")
    // ★ js-yaml 用于解析嵌套结构的 links.yml(自实现 parser 不支持嵌套数组)
    script(src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/js-yaml@4.1.0/dist/js-yaml.min.js")
    script(src="/tools/tools.js")